SUMMARY:Power BI Roadmap: Strategy\, Vision and Demos
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThe fourth session in the FabCon an
 d SQLCon recap series will cover Power BI\, everyone's favorite tool to tu
 rn insights into actions and deliver enterprise analytics at scale in Fabr
 ic. In this session discover why businesses standardize on Power BI\, lear
 n about building a data-driven culture\, and get a first look at upcoming 
 features that unlock your data's potential.\n\n📍 This session is a part
  of a series. [Learn more here](https://developer.microsoft.com/reactor/se
 ries/S-1660/?wt.mc_id=meetup_S-1660_webpage_reactor)
